<title>USA: Concord, N.H., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Concord, N.H., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $16.247 million of Concord, N.H., general obligation capital improvement bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.017 percent.</p>
